            "text": "Buyers describe it as sweet, creamy and close to the pineapple soft serve, especially when blended with frozen fruit or plant milk. The most common complaints are that it is sweeter than expected and that some flavors in the line taste slightly artificial or gritty when shaken with water. We have not tasted it; this summarizes buyer reviews."
